      "content": "grounding doesn't really work for me. it just makes me more aware of how much everything sucks. i feel like i’m constantly on edge and everything is just... too much to carry anymore. like there's no way to actually turn it all off. i just want to find a way to have some actual peace, you know? like, real peace that doesn't go away.",
